{%- comment -%}
  Default Vitality pillar when no blocks configured.
{%- endcomment -%}

<article class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__pillar">
  <div class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__media">
    {% render 'hp-science-media',
      show_placeholder: true,
      placeholder_label: 'Upload Vitality pillar image or animation',
      min_height: 520
    %}
  </div>

  <div class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__panel" style="background: {{ panel_bg | default: '#fcfaf2' }};">
    <p class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__pillar-num">Pillar 01</p>
    <h3 class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__pillar-title" style="color: {{ accent | default: '#008667' }};">Vitality</h3>
    <p class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__para">Cell renewal. The foundation of everything else. Without consistent renewal, nothing that's applied to the surface reaches the cells that need it.</p>
    <hr class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__rule" aria-hidden="true">
    <p class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__para">Sun-safe bio-retinoids accelerate the renewal cycle without stripping the barrier. Active day and night, no sun restriction.</p>
    <div class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__stat-wrap">
      <p class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__stat-value" style="color: {{ accent | default: '#008667' }};">+38%*</p>
      <p class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__stat-label">Cell Proliferation · At 48 Hours</p>
    </div>
    <p class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__footnote" style="color: {{ footnote_color | default: '#888888' }};">* In Vitro Study Conducted to Test Effect of Bio-Retinoids on Human Dermal Fibroblasts.</p>
  </div>
</article>
